    "order": 90,
    "anchor": "achieving-secondary-missions-2",
    "summary": "When each team's turn ends, both teams do the following, the team taking the turn first:\n\n1. For each Secondary Mission whose conditions your team met, you may gain its VP; with Tactical Secondary Missions, that card is then achieved and discarded.\n2. On your own turn, with Tactical Secondary Missions, you may discard 1 or more active Secondary Missions to gain 1 CP.",
